{"meta":{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","type":"tv","name":"Clarity 4K","logo":"https://i.imgur.com/M87kbVk.png","poster":"https://i.imgur.com/M87kbVk.png","posterShape":"square","genres":["English Entertainment"],"channelNumber":922,"behaviorHints":{"isLive":true,"defaultVideoId":"ftv_Clarity4K_us"},"videos":[{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Clarity 4K – Live","released":"2026-11-28T00:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T00:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Clarity 4K – Live","released":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Clarity 4K – Live","released":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T06:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T09:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Clarity 4K – Live","released":"2026-11-28T09:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T09:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T10:34:02Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Eco-Heroines","released":"2026-11-28T10:34:02Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T10:34:02Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T11:35:00Z","overview":"Between the plains of the pampas and the peaks of the Andes, the condor, the sacred bird is close to extinction. In Argentina, Vanesa Astore and her team lead a reintroduction program by promoting their reproduction in captivity. In addition to the creation of a network of protected natural areas for the conservation of condors, Vanesa is committed to the fight against the use of toxic baits by cattle breeders.","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Family","released":"2026-11-28T11:35:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T11:35:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T12:32:03Z","overview":"Journey to the beautiful and dangerous places that play host to wildlife's migrations and congregations.","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Animal Empires","released":"2026-11-28T12:32:03Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T12:32:03Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:29:05Z","overview":"'Rebuilding an Empire\" - Just off the mouth of the Mississippi, a rare breed of Chinese deer has found a new home--and new hope--for its embattled species. Further east, the gopher tortoise, one of nature's expert diggers, recovers from catastrophic population decline brought on by human encroachment and habitat loss. Track the exciting efforts to revive some of the lesser-known animal empires","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Animal Odyssey","released":"2026-11-28T13:29:05Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:29:05Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T14:29:48Z","overview":"Like us, humans, they are primates sometimes their gestures resemble ours, their looks, their expressions... We most often think about the Amazonian jungle when we think of our cousin the monkey.","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Animal Odyssey","released":"2026-11-28T14:29:48Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:29:48Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:30:36Z","overview":"It is said that the horse is the most noble conquest of humankind. Thanks to it, humankind has been able to master the great spaces, to wage war, and to trace trade routes.","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Undiscovered Vistas","released":"2026-11-28T15:30:36Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:30:36Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:24:51Z","overview":"A rugged sky-high plain in the heart of Bolivia, the Andean Altiplano is a natural wonder full of creatures adapted to some of Earth's most brutal habitats. Its surreal deserts, restless volcanoes, and vast seas have remained unchanged for millennia.","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_Clarity4K_us","title":"Undiscovered Vistas","released":"2026-11-28T16:24:51Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:24:51Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:19:05Z","overview":"Zion National Park is a kingdom of towering rock in the rugged badlands of Utah. Combining soaring spir